    {
      "text": "be healed; and the labor which they had to perform was to look, 1 Ne. 17:41. look to the great Mediator, 2 Ne. 2:28. righteous that … look forward unto Christ … for the signs … shall not perish, 2 Ne. 26:8. which blindness came by looking beyond the mark, Jacob 4:14. prophets … persuading them to look forward unto the Messiah, Jarom 1:11. he has wherewith that he can look, and translate, Mosiah 8:13. Do you look forward … to stand before God, Alma 5:15. they … could not look upon sin save it were with abhorrence, Alma 13:12 (45:16; D&C 1:31). type was raised up … whosoever would look upon it might live, Alma 33:19. look to God and live, Alma 37:47. power given unto them that they did turn and look, Hel. 5:37. should look upon that serpent should live, even so as many as should look upon the Son of God, Hel. 8:15.",
